    "body": "I don't think we should make the process of hand-syntax-highlighting Web IDL in the HTML spec any more arduous than it already is :)\r\n\r\nIf you think adding semantic `<var>`s here across the Bikeshed + Wattsi ecosystem is worth doing, then a Bikeshed issue is probably the way to go.",
